  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. Grill the chorizo for 2-3 minutes per side, or until nicely charred.",
    "3. Meanwhile, toast the bread on the grill or in a toaster.",
    "4. Slice the chorizo into 1-inch pieces.",
    "5. Assemble the choripan by placing a few slices of chorizo onto each bread bun.",
    "6. Top with red onion, parsley, and a dollop of chimichurri sauce.",
    "7. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "8. Serve immediately and enjoy!"
